@startuml
title WPF — startup failure
actor Operator
participant "WPF App (UI thread)" as App
participant "Startup operation" as Startup
participant "Host and DI container" as Host

Operator -> App : Launch application
App -> App : Show splash
App -> Startup : Build host, initialize database or open main window
Startup --> App : Startup exception
App -> App : Record startup exception in the WPF log if available
App --> Operator : Show startup error
Operator -> App : Dismiss error
App -> App : Shutdown(1), then OnExit
opt host was built
  App -> Host : Dispose
end
@enduml
